  "description": "FAMDOP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H88 Cu2 Ho3 N8 O17 1+,5(C1 H4 O1),C1 H1 Cl3,Cl1 O4 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Ho01 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho02 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho03 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Cu04 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu05 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.268-3.853 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.24-113.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho3Cu2(LH)4(MeOH)]ClO4·5MeOH·CHCl3·H2O.",
